[00:20.06]1. How great our need today for discernment,
[00:24.50]To know the things that are true,
[00:31.29]To know which things have greater importance,
[00:37.39]To know which things we must do!
[00:39.92](Chorus)
[00:42.45]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[00:48.49]Make God’s heart glad;
[00:51.49]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[00:54.64]When we discern,
[00:57.79]And when we do the important things!
[01:09.31]2. And what could be of greater importance
[01:20.25]Than sharing Kingdom good news,
[01:23.92]To search for those who hunger for truth
[01:27.58]And to help them God’s way to choose?
[01:31.25](Chorus)
[01:34.25]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[01:37.25]Make God’s heart glad;
[01:40.60]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[01:43.60]When we discern,
[01:46.60]And when we do the important things!
[02:08.54]3. If we take care to do what’s important,
[02:15.14]Then true contentment we’ll find.
[02:20.91]The peace surpassing all understanding
[02:26.68]Will guard our heart and our mind.
[02:32.45](Chorus)
[02:38.23]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[02:44.00]Make God’s heart glad;
[02:49.77]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[02:55.54]When we discern,
[03:01.31]And when we do the important things!